{"articleNo":"72256","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=72256&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[12.18]2012 겨울계절수업 수강료 추가 납부일 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.12.17","hit":"5626","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">2012 겨울계절수업 수강료 추가 납부일 안내</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;겨울계절수업 폐강 과목 수강정정 신청자 및 1차 추가납부일(12.13)에 수강료를 납부하지 못한 학생은 추가 납부일에 필히 납부하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. 납부대상 : 폐강 과목 수강정정 신청자 및 추가 납부일에 수강료를 납부하지 못한 학생</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 추가납부일 : 12.18(화) 오전 9시-오후 5시 은행마감시간까지, 1일간, <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">농협만 가능</span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"></span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">(★미납시 수강신청 내역 삭제)</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◐ 고지서출력 : 원스톱서비스-학사관리-등록-등록금고지내역조회/출력</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (12.18(화) 당일 고지서 출력 가능)</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 금액 : 학점당 25,000원(2학점 강좌 50,000원, 3학점 강좌 75,000원)</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. 등록금납부 방법</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■ 개인별 가상계좌번호로 수강료 납부/입금(인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 등 이용시)</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 받는 사람 이름을(학생본인이름) 필히 확인</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생이름이 아니라도 상관없음(보호자 통장으로 이체 가능)</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 가상계좌번호는 매학기마다 변경될 수 있습니다.</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 본인 원스톱서비스에서 가상계좌확인 후 납부 </font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 해당 납부 기간내 반드시 납부(은행마감시간 참조)</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 타 부서 계좌 입금(경리팀계좌, 학생처계좌, 국제교류교육원계좌, 기획협력처계좌 등)</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;및 원스톱서비스 본인 환불계좌 입금시 수강인정 불허</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 납부 확인 방법 :&nbsp; 수강료 납부한 다음날 10:00부터 확인 가능</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◐ 원스톱서비스-학사관리-등록-등록금납부/반환내역조회</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
